From 87f2afd12d905b539dd48bff9d49030ce2d6a2c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: iimmyy <i.a.martins001@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 15:32:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 49/50] llama: receptors inside each room.
 llama_set_adapter_recep(ctx, data, len) sets per-layer multipliers at run
 time, n_layer x 3 floats, or clears them with NULL: focus scales Q after rope
 (attention sharpness; K is untouched, so the KV that later Gemma 4 layers
 share stays valid), excite multiplies the FFN gate's scale before the GELU
 (after the gate's LoRA), loud scales the attention block's post-norm write
 before it joins the residual. All 1.0 leaves the output unchanged. Only Gemma
 4 graphs read them. Written 2026-10-23 for the receptors-in-the-model track
 (LittleGuy tools/mind/receptors, lg-mind "recep"); committed 2026-11-07 as it
 was then, not rebuilt or re-tested on that day.

